</style><h2>BlinkyBot 0.3.3</h2><ul><li><strong>后端分成供应商和本地 CLI。</strong> 设置里的「后端与模型」先显示供应商（API key 和基础 URL），再显示本地 CLI（命令和终端登录）。</li><li><strong>默认 Bot 叫 Blinky。</strong> 仍叫 Assistant 的种子 Bot 会改名。你自己改过名字的 Bot 保持原样。</li><li><strong>状态说明跟随设置语言。</strong> 缺少密钥或 CLI 时，中文界面用中文说明。英文写作 “an OpenAI key”。</li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-bot/releases/tag/v0.3.3">在 GitHub 查看更新说明</a></p>]]></description>
            <description xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[<style>
  h2 { font-size: 1.05em; margin: 0 0 .5em; }
  ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2em; }
  li { margin: .3em 0; }
  p { margin: .8em 0 0; }
</style><h2>BlinkyBot 0.3.3</h2><ul><li><strong>Backends are split into providers and local CLIs.</strong> Settings opens 供应商 (API key and base URL) above 本地 CLI (command and terminal sign-in).</li><li><strong>The default bot is Blinky.</strong> A seeded bot that is still named Assistant is renamed. A bot you renamed stays as you named it.</li><li><strong>Status lines follow the settings language.</strong> A missing key or CLI is described in Chinese by default. English says “an OpenAI key”.</li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-bot/releases/tag/v0.3.3">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
